  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ethiopia - Addis Ababa Fuelwood Plantation Project</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">&#xc9;thiopie - Projet de plantation de bois de chauffage &#xe0; Addis-Abeba</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the project is to encrease the fuelwood supply for Addis Ababa market. The project would also provide infrastructural improvements and social amenities, e.g. schools clinics, shops, water and electricity etc. for the population in the project area.</narrative>
  </description>
